---
name: Analyze a D4 packet stream
description: |
  Reads PCAP data that a D4 analyzer writes to a named pipe. D4 sensors
  stream captures to a D4 server, and the server dispatches them to analyzers.
  Point an analyzer at the pipe, and Tenzir decodes packets as they arrive.
---

// Docs:
//   https://github.com/D4-project/d4-core (server and analyzer queues)
//   https://tenzir.com/docs/reference/operators/from_file
//   https://tenzir.com/docs/reference/operators/read_pcap
//   https://tenzir.com/docs/reference/functions/decapsulate
//
// Create the pipe with `mkfifo /var/run/d4/pcap.fifo`. NGSOTI's sensors
// capture full packets, so the stream contains `pcap` type 1 data.
from_file "/var/run/d4/pcap.fifo" {
  read_pcap
}
this = {...this, ...decapsulate(this)}
publish "blackhole"
